    "PhotoTrail can set/update the GPS time and date stamps when updating locations. These timestamps are the same as the image create date and time but relative to GMP/UTC, not the local time. When setting this option it is important that the TimeZone (edit menu) is correct for the images being saved.  Please see the PhotoTrail help pages for more information on setting the time zone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PhotoTrail can set/update the GPS time and date stamps when updating locations. These timestamps are the same as the image create date and time but relative to GMP/UTC, not the local time. When setting this option it is important that the TimeZone (edit menu) is correct for the images being saved.  Please see the PhotoTrail help pages for more information on setting the time zone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新位置时，将 GPS 日期和时间设为拍摄时间对应的 UTC 时间。请先在“编辑”菜单中确认照片的拍摄时区。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新位置時，將 GPS 日期和時間設為拍攝時間對應的 UTC 時間。請先在“編輯”菜單中確認照片的拍攝時區。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位置情報の更新時にGPS日時も更新できます。GPS日時は撮影日時をUTCに変換した値です。編集メニューのカメラのタイムゾーンが正しいことを確認してください。詳しくはヘルプを参照してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "위치를 수정할 때 GPS 날짜와 시간도 업데이트할 수 있습니다. GPS 시간은 촬영 시간을 UTC로 변환한 값입니다. 편집 메뉴의 카메라 시간대가 올바른지 확인하세요. 자세한 내용은 도움말을 참고하세요."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PhotoTrail puede actualizar la fecha y hora GPS al modificar ubicaciones. Se usa la hora de captura convertida a UTC. Comprueba que la zona horaria de la cámara en el menú Edición sea correcta. Consulta la ayuda para más información."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O PhotoTrail pode atualizar a data e hora GPS ao alterar localizações. Usa a hora de captura convertida para UTC. Confira o fuso horário da câmera no menu Editar. Consulte a ajuda para mais informações."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PhotoTrail will not place a copy of updated files in your selected backup folder if this box is checked. If there are issues while updates are in progress it is possible that image files could be corrupted. Allowing PhotoTrail to make a backup before updates occur is recommended.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PhotoTrail will not place a copy of updated files in your selected backup folder if this box is checked. If there are issues while updates are in progress it is possible that image files could be corrupted. Allowing PhotoTrail to make a backup before updates occur is recommended."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "勾选后将不再备份照片。如果保存时发生故障，照片可能受损，建议保留备份。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "勾選後將不再備份照片。如果保存時發生故障，照片可能受損，建議保留備份。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オンにすると、更新前のファイルはバックアップされません。更新中の問題で写真が破損する可能性があるため、バックアップを推奨します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 옵션을 켜면 수정 전 파일을 백업하지 않습니다. 수정 중 문제가 생기면 사진이 손상될 수 있으므로 백업을 권장합니다."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si activas esta opción, no se guardarán copias antes de actualizar los archivos. Un fallo durante la escritura podría dañarlos. Se recomienda mantener las copias de seguridad."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se ativada, esta opção impede o backup antes de atualizar os arquivos. Uma falha durante a gravação pode danificá-los. É recomendável manter os backups."
          }
        }
      }
    },
