    "同一拍摄时间对应多个不同位置，需选择轨迹来源。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same shooting time corresponds to multiple different locations, and the track source needs to be selected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
