            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is no need to fill in the AMap key for Apple Map; you can switch the map source on the details page later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "苹果地图无需填写高德密钥；以后可在详情页切换地图来源。"
